    {
      "number": 63,
      "id": "g2f9d3c916e9_0_816",
      "text": "summary\ntimeline\ndeaths\ninvestigations\nrebuilding\n\nErnest S. Batterson’s rendering of the proposed new church building. The sanctuary on the left was completed in 1929. However, the church house on the right would not be built until 1950, in a somewhat simplified form. The massive central tower has never been realized. (KPL)\nMEC\n",
      "media": [
        {
          "type": "image"
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
