      "text": "summary\ntimeline\ndeaths\ninvestigations\nrebuilding\n\nThe third First Methodist building has overlooked Bronson Park since its completion in 1929. Photograph take by David Kohrman, Kalamazoo Public Library staff, March 2013.\nMEC\n",
      "media": [
        {
          "type": "image"
        }
      ],
      "links": []
